ETHICAL USE ADDENDUM (non-binding statement of intent)

This software is intended exclusively for the analysis of PUBLIC, openly
available information (published media, RSS feeds, official communiqués, and
data obtained through authorized public APIs) for legitimate purposes such as
journalism, academic research, electoral observation, civil-society analysis,
and public-discourse studies. It must NOT be used to surveil private
individuals, de-anonymize persons, track physical locations of people, or
facilitate harassment, intimidation, or political persecution of any person
or group. Users are responsible for complying with all applicable laws,
platform terms of service, and data-protection regulations.
